@Snowflake is Introducing Cortex Training, this is the project my AI Research team has been working on since the beginning of this year

https://t.co/5uwUh0E3AP

Cortex Training is Snowflake’s serverless offering for building and deploying customized open-weight models. AI teams retain fine-grained control over SFT, RL and custom training loops, while Snowflake manages the GPU infrastructure so developers can focus on improving models rather than operating clusters.
